    whyWeWin: ["You don't need enterprise. Magento is built for businesses doing PKR 10+ crore annually. If you're doing PKR 50 lakh to PKR 2 crore, MatjarX is your platform.", "You grow into the features you need. Start with Launch (5 pages, PKR 4,500). Move to Boost (30 pages, PKR 15,600) as you scale. Then Growth (50 pages, PKR 27,000). Then Platinum (unlimited, PKR 55,000) when you're ready. No massive upfront investment.", "Your time matters. Magento takes 8–16 weeks to set up. MatjarX takes 5–10 days. That's 3 months faster to your first sale.", "Your support is local. Magento support is global (expensive, 24/7 but impersonal). MatjarX support is Pakistani (personal, understands your market).", "Example: A fashion e-commerce brand with 200 products:", "Magento Commerce approach:\n- Setup: 8–12 weeks + PKR 500,000 developer fees\n- Monthly hosting: PKR 20,000–50,000\n- Monthly support: PKR 15,000\n- Annual: PKR 420,000–680,000 + setup costs\n- Total Year 1: PKR 900,000–1.2 million", "MatjarX approach:\n- Setup: 5–10 days (ready to sell immediately)\n- Monthly: PKR 55,000 (Platinum plan)\n- Annual: PKR 660,000\n- Total Year 1: PKR 682,500 (setup + 12 months)", "Same features. PKR 200,000–520,000 savings. 2.5 months faster to market."],
